Dex-EquiTact clean method implementation

This repository implements the method described in Dex-EquiTact_95.pdf.
The original EquiTact/ImplicitRDP workspace was inspected to identify contracts and
mismatches. No legacy source files, third-party model weights, hardware SDKs, or
datasets are vendored here. The Python implementation is newly written.

PyTorch, NumPy, PyYAML, pytest, and optional Zarr are external dependencies with
their own licenses. The legacy workspace's aggregated third-party license file
does not describe the contents of this new repository.
